.TH HINTERHALT 6.SH NAMEhinterhalt \- a maze game, in German.SH SYNOPSIS\fBhinterhalt\fR.SH DESCRIPTIONA small maze game with its text in German.  It asks\fBBrauchen Sie eine Anleitung (J/N)?\fR-- do you need instructions -- and then draws the board: walls, theplayer and a target, in inverse video.  It draws with VT100 escapesequences, so it wants a terminal that reads them..SH NOTESNeeds Microware's\fBcio\fR.\fR